{"title":"종말의 세라프 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=ALull/dJMcacd0H3Z/gKGBabrDHUkm08qKIyFSKk&filename=th3","synopsis":"미지의 바이러스에 의해 인류는 괴멸하고, 아이들만이 살아남아 지하 도시에서 뱀파이어의 지배를 받고 있었다. 지기 싫어하는 기 센 소년, 햐쿠야 유이치로는 동료들의 희생으로 홀로 탈출에 성공, 복수를 맹세한다. 유이치로가 본 새로운 지상 세계란?! 한편, 흡혈귀에게 친구를 잃은 유이치로는 복수를 위해 일본제귀군에 입대하고, 그곳에서 새로운 동료들과 흡혈귀 섬멸을 위해 싸우지만-…?! \n\nOWARI NO SERAPH © 2012 by Takaya Kagami, Yamato Yamamoto, Daisuke Furuya/SHUEISHA Inc. ","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":42,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":121}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":223,"change":{"type":"down","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":150,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":229,"change":{"type":"down","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":292,"change":{"type":"down","amount":63}},{"date":"2026-11-20","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":148}},{"date":"2026-11-21","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-11-22","rank":244,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-11-24","rank":135,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-25","rank":97,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-11-26","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":106}},{"date":"2026-11-27","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":74}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":75,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":70,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":74,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":74,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":79,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":76,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":70,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-11-20","rank":237,"change":{"type":"down","amount":167}},{"date"